'''Kay-Tap square''' was a location on the [[planet]] [[Rodia]]. During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] [[Second mission to Rodia|traveled]] to the square to stop the [[bounty hunter]] [[Cad Bane]] from kidnapping a [[Force-sensitive]] [[Rodian]] child named [[Wee Dunn]].<ref name="Children of the Force" />

